        "14 findings: 4 high, 5 medium, 5 low; verdict request changes; every high and medium applied as plan and task edits",
        "high ARCH-001 applied: every reader and writer of stored record permissions named and moved to the level query or the crediting class (plan D2 table, T016, T018, T004 seeds)",
